  "problem": "Solve $(4x-5)^{4}+25\\le 9.$",
  "worked_solution": "Isolating the quartic term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(4x-5)^{4}+25 & \\le 9 \\\\ (4x-5)^{4} & \\le -16.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, $(4x-5)^{4}\\ge 0$ for all values of $x$ because the power $(4)$ is even.\n\nTherefore, there is no solution to the given inequality.",
